---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="What this preview of the Rotaract Europe site does with personal data."
>
  <main id="content" class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
      <h1>This preview keeps no accounts</h1>
    </header>
    <p>Rotaract Europe ASBL, 61 Val Sainte-Croix, L-1371 Luxembourg, is the organisation. For this working copy, write to board@rotaracteurope.eu.</p>
    <p>The pages do not set cookies, do not run analytics, and do not take registrations. Names of board members and country representatives are the ones already published on rotaracteurope.eu.</p>
    <p>The WordPress site that still serves the domain has its own privacy policy: <a href="https://rotaracteurope.eu/privacy-policy/">Privacy policy on the current site</a>. That policy stays in force for the live domain until the board replaces it at cutover.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
